        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_38684216",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "深空联合曾尝试过向其所在的区域探索，但并未收获任何值得被记录下来的成果。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 3,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 4,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_34ce06e5",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "过往时，随着隧者的到来而被安置于此的锚点，是开启隧门的关键。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 4,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 5,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_eeaaa9bc",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "我们总要推开那扇门，即便它最初是为了把危险阻隔在外。",
